o asserts a drifted status yields 'no label'. Unless the drift branch short-circuits before the subscript (or uses `.get`), the stamp evaluation KeyErrors on exactly the drift case the plan claims to handle silently.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f026c4ca07c110e45","impact":0.536,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 4 ('stamp `rebar-status:<local>` iff `config.jira_to_local_status.get(status_map[local]) != local`')","norm_id":"n4284988b08fb608a","priority":0.469,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A ticket whose local status is absent from the effective per-project status_map reaches _diff_status_annotation_labels"],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"State the rule as: stamp iff `local in status_map and config.jira_to_local_status.get(status_map[local]) != local` — the `local in status_map` guard makes a drifted status fall through to no-label with no subscript exception.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.875,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"medium","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add a negative test asserting the shared `rebar-